BY022 [*] `@staticmethod` can be written as `static`
  --> BY022.by:45:5
   |
43 |     # only the last decorator is rewritten; the next run takes the one above it
44 |     @final
45 |     @staticmethod
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
46 |     def both() -> int:
47 |         return 0
   |
help: Replace with the `static` modifier
   |
44 |     @final
   -     @staticmethod
   -     def both() -> int:
45 +     static def both() -> int:
